==Serbo-Croatian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|sh|uza}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|sh|sla-pro|*vъz}} ({{cog|ru|воз-}}, {{cog|pl|wz-}}). Cognate with {{cog|lt|už}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{qualifier|unaccented}} {{IPA|sh|/uz/}}

===Preposition===
{{sh-preposition}} {{qualifier|+ [[accusative case]]}}

# [[up]], [[upward]]
#: {{ux|sh|ići '''uz''' stepenice|to go upstairs|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''uz''' brdo|uphill|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''uz''' r(ij)eku|upriver|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|peti/penjati se '''uz''' konopac|to climb a rope|inline=1}}
# [[next to]], [[beside]], [[alongside]], [[by]]
#: {{ux|sh|'''uz''' cestu|next to the road|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''uza''' samu granicu|on the very border|inline=1}}
# [[with]], [[while]], [[along with]] {{qualifier|circumstances or conditions accompanying the action}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''uz''' sm(ij)eh/plač|with laughter/crying|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''uz''' p(j)esmu|while singing|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''uz''' piće|with a drink; while having a drink|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|p(j)evati '''uz''' klavir|to sing while the piano is playing|inline=1}}
# [[in spite of]], [[despite]] (= {{m|sh|pȍred}})
#: {{ux|sh|'''uza''' sve to|despite all that|inline=1}}

====Usage notes====
The variant form {{m|sh|uza}} is used before enclitics and consonants that would make it difficult to pronounce.

====Related terms====
* {{l|sh|uz-}}

